    <section class="proposal-page mint" id="breakdown">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="page-head section-label-only">
          <span class="section-no">04 · What you get</span>
        </div>
        <div class="section-intro">
          <div>
            <h2 class="title">Every feature, <span>and why it matters.</span></h2>
          </div>
          <p class="lead">Pick an option to see its full list and price.</p>
        </div>
<div class="sf-opt-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose an option"><button type="button" class="sf-opt-tab" data-opt-tab="1" role="tab" aria-selected="false"><small>Option 1</small><b>Operations Portal</b><span>₦11,000,000</span></button><button type="button" class="sf-opt-tab active" data-opt-tab="2" role="tab" aria-selected="true"><small>Option 2</small><b>Customer Portal</b><span>₦18,000,000</span></button><button type="button" class="sf-opt-tab" data-opt-tab="3" role="tab" aria-selected="false"><small>Option 3</small><b>Full Platform</b><span>₦25,000,000</span></button></div>
<div class="sf-block sf-opt-panel" data-opt-panel="1" hidden="">
          <div class="sf-block-head"><div><small>Option 1 · Run the business</small><h3>Operations Portal</h3><p>Your team runs freight and ATM jobs in one portal. Customers follow a tracking link.</p><p class="sf-meta">14 features · live by 29 January 2027 · maintenance after month 6 ₦350,000/month, optional</p></div>
            <div class="sf-block-total"><span>Total</span><strong>₦11,000,000</strong><em>₦4,400,000 to start · ₦6,600,000 at launch</em></div></div>
          <div class="sf-table-wrap"><table class="sf-table">
            <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>What you get</th><th>How it helps</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
<tr><td>01</td><td><b>Shipment control board</b><span>All air, ocean and road shipments in one list, with stage, ETA and owner.</span></td><td>Answer "where is it?" in seconds.</td><td><strong>₦1,500,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>02</td><td><b>Nigerian customs steps</b><span>Form M, PAAR, duty, examination, release, TDO or gate pass, then delivery.</span></td><td>See which customs step is holding each shipment.</td><td><strong>₦1,000,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>03</td><td><b>Status updates by your team</b><span>Open a shipment, pick the new step, add a note or document, save.</span></td><td>One update keeps everyone informed.</td><td><strong>₦900,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>04</td><td><b>Customer tracking link</b><span>A private tracking page per shipment, updated when your team saves.</span></td><td>Fewer "any update?" calls.</td><td><strong>₦800,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>05</td><td><b>Delay alerts for your team</b><span>Each step has an expected time. Late steps alert the person in charge.</span></td><td>Fix delays before customers notice.</td><td><strong>₦500,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>06</td><td><b>Shipment documents</b><span>Bill of lading, airway bill, invoice, PAAR and proof of delivery on each shipment.</span></td><td>No more searching inboxes.</td><td><strong>₦500,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>07</td><td><b>ATM job tracker</b><span>Decommissioning, relocation, staging, civil works, cannibalisation and refurbishment, each with a checklist.</span></td><td>Every ATM job done the same way.</td><td><strong>₦1,000,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>08</td><td><b>ATM machine register</b><span>Each machine with bank, branch, serial, photos, parts and sign-offs.</span></td><td>A clear audit trail for banks.</td><td><strong>₦900,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>09</td><td><b>Website editor</b><span>Edit pages, services, photos and blog posts. Read every enquiry.</span></td><td>Keep the site current without a developer.</td><td><strong>₦400,000</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>10</td><td><b>Customer CRM</b><span>Every customer, contact, shipment, quote and follow-up in one place.</span></td><td>Anyone can pick up any customer.</td><td><strong>₦800,000</strong></td></tr>
